Our professional liability insurance coverage of up to 10 million euros per claim, along with general civil liability cover, provides a basis for managing potential risks associated with data protection and privacy breaches. Certificates of insurance are available upon request, which can be provided as part of our tender response to demonstrate our compliance and risk management capabilities.
